<h2><a id="Exemples" name="Exemples"></a>Graphic examples</h2>
<p>ACP applications are varied: enhancement prior to visual interpretation (Figure 1), processing prior to classification as a useful technique for reducing the dimensionality of the data in cases of multi-temporal analysis or hyperspectral data, denoising, etc.</p>
 
